From a34dd14e75b9f14b2f89dabd89daeb66d564d547 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Tridgell <andrew@tridgell.net>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:27:53 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] native: WebSplat entry (websplat.cc): verification and
 prior mapping through memory

- ws_v_*: two-view verification per pair with an explicit camera, COLMAP's
  matcher-controller clearing below min_num_inliers, per-pair RANSAC seed
- ws_m_*: sfm.py prior_mapping(): telemetry poses with position covariance,
  triangulation, pose-prior BA, filtering per round; progress/stop hooks;
  binary model export to memory
- legacy313/: COLMAP 3.13 two-view estimators and RANSAC with a
  libstdc++-compatible sampler, for parity with the native reference
- colmap_websplat target (websplat-colmap.mjs/.wasm, FILESYSTEM=0)
- THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md covers the WebSplat build and the 3.13 port
